# spec-integrator cache & reports
# .spec-integrator/doc_cache.db was previously committed as the actual
# LLM-audit evidence (risk assessments, judge verdicts) the Obligation Gate
# reads -- see the superseded rationale this replaces. It repeatedly
# rewrote as a full ~60-100MB blob per revision (SQLite binaries don't diff),
# which dominated the repo's .git size; its history was purged separately.
# It is now untracked and regenerated locally via `spec-integrator sync` /
# `llm-judge` per tools/README.md -- CI's automatic triggers are disabled
# accordingly (.github/workflows/document-lint.yml) since a fresh checkout
# no longer carries pre-existing audit evidence.
.spec-integrator/doc_cache.db
doc_report.md
spec_report.md
doc_graph.json

